<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>GroundService — Landing Institucional</title>
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        background: #202928;
        color: #E2DAD2;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .container {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 640px;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 7, 58, 0.4);
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #FF073A;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      h1 span { color: #FF073A; }
      p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #999;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .stack {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .stack span {
        padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #aaa;
      }
      .status {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #4ade80;
      }
      .status::before {
        content: '';
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        background: #4ade80;
        border-radius: 50%;
        animation: pulse 2s infinite;
      }
      @keyframes pulse {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
        50% { opacity: 0.4; }
      }
      footer {
        margin-top: 3rem;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #555;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge">En desarrollo</div>
      <h1>Ground<span>Service</span></h1>
      <p>
        Tu landing institucional se está construyendo.<br />
        Servicios de mantención y soporte técnico para minería — norte de Chile.
      </p>
      <div class="stack">
        <span>Astro 7</span>
        <span>React 19</span>
        <span>Tailwind v4</span>
        <span>TypeScript</span>
        <span>Vercel</span>
      </div>
      <div class="status">Proyecto levantado correctamente</div>
      <footer>by stratto.dev</footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
